@Sub2ApiReport.Updater_HostAddress = http://localhost:5081
@UpdaterToken = replace-with-shared-updater-token

### 存活探针（无需令牌）
GET {{Sub2ApiReport.Updater_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Updater 状态（需要令牌）
GET {{Sub2ApiReport.Updater_HostAddress}}/internal/v1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{UpdaterToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 检查固定仓库最新稳定 Release（需要令牌）
POST {{Sub2ApiReport.Updater_HostAddress}}/internal/v1/check
Authorization: Bearer {{UpdaterToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 查看升级计划（需要令牌，安装保持关闭）
GET {{Sub2ApiReport.Updater_HostAddress}}/internal/v1/plan
Authorization: Bearer {{UpdaterToken}}
Accept: application/json